# Inventory

## Ürünleri fiyata göre sıralama
* User enters "standard_user" into "username" on "login" page.
* User enters "secret_sauce" into "password" on "login" page.
* User clicks "loginButton" on "login" page.
* User selects "Price (low to high)" from "sortDropdown" dropdown on "inventory" page.


## Ürünleri harfe göre sıralama ve sepete ekleme
* User enters "standard_user" into "username" on "login" page.
* User enters "secret_sauce" into "password" on "login" page.
* User clicks "loginButton" on "login" page.
* User selects "Name (A to Z)" from "sortDropdown" dropdown on "inventory" page.
* User clicks "anotherItem" on "inventory" page.
* User clicks "cartIcon" on "inventory" page.
* User should see "cartItem" on "cart" page.

## Detay görüntüleme
* User enters "standard_user" into "username" on "login" page.
* User enters "secret_sauce" into "password" on "login" page.
* User clicks "loginButton" on "login" page.
*User should see "productsTitle" on "inventory" page.
* User clicks "backpack" on "inventory" page.
